null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.7-dev5, 4.7-beta1 and `master` (fd8c4ef3e982b9e6973c858f6c3354abc1331b6a)\n- Not reproducible in Godot 4.7-dev4 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\n- Android - Samsung Galaxy XR - Adreno 740\n- Android - Meta Quest 3 - Adreno 740\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn any XR app using OpenGL, on Godot v4.7-dev5 or later, it renders a white void :-)\n\nI've bisected this to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108219 where some `ubo:X` numbers were updated in `scene.glsl` and `sky.glsl` to accomidate a new UBO, except the ones for multiview weren't updated\n\n~~I'll post a PR that fixes it in a moment~~\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the demo project from https://github.com/GodotVR/godot_openxr_vendors\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nRun the demo project from https://github.com/GodotVR/godot_openxr_vendors","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"pub